c synthetic hex lattice (lat=2), pointy-top + axial +Z
c pointy-top hex cell: unit side, center origin.  Six side planes (P) at
c 30/90/150/210/270/330 deg (vertex at +X = pointy-top) + top/bottom caps.
c Lattice cell fill = 2x2 hex array, single axial layer (0:0 in k).
1  p   0.866  0.5   0  -0.866
2  p   0.866 -0.5   0  -0.866
